<section class="gd-about-intro" aria-label="About The Global Desk">
  <p class="gd-about-intro__statement">The Global Desk is an <strong>Interactive Global Intelligence &amp; News Platform.</strong></p>
  <p>Headquartered in Dhaka, Bangladesh, we cover South Asia, Asia and global affairs through news, research, explainers and analysis. We connect important developments with useful context so readers can understand what is happening and why it matters.</p>
</section>

<section class="gd-about-mission" aria-labelledby="about-mission-title">
  <span class="gd-static-eyebrow">Our mission</span>
  <h2 id="about-mission-title">Make the important understandable.</h2>
  <p>We aim to make complex developments easier to understand through clear reporting, useful context and thoughtful perspectives. We help readers look beyond headlines and understand why events matter.</p>
</section>

